  <item>
    <title>vol4.宠物行业乱象！裁耳！断尾！拔牙！这是在干嘛？？？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/669a5cb937236c546e569c33</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">669a5cb937236c546e569c33</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 20 Jul 2024 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期请来了杭州顶级宠物医院的老板，朝吹一枚的eric～</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期主要是针对养猫人的一期Q&amp;A：</span></p><span></span><p><span>干货满满的一篇，给各位妞标注好了时间点，自行观看。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a> ：猫是不是一定要做绝育？&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a> :绝育后猫是不是都会发腮？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> ：猫如何科学减肥？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="448">07:28</a>：国产粮能买么？怎么选猫粮？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> ：猫有必要吃保健品么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="765">12:45</a>：宠物行业乱象，疯狂的主人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="862">14:22</a>: 对（折耳，曼基康）有先天基因缺陷的品种猫怎么看？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="912">15:12</a> 领养流浪猫的好处&amp;坏处？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="994">16:34</a> 猫爱掉毛怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1026">17:06</a> 猫爱乱尿怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1114">18:34</a> 猫咪疫苗补打问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 猫要不要买保险？怎么买？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1230">20:30</a> 猫毛过敏怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1435">23:55</a> 买猫渠道红黑榜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1531">25:31</a> 朋友狗市买到星期狗的遭遇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1631">27:11</a> 猫咪不亲人怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1759">29:19</a> 猫咪要不要带出门？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2053">34:13</a> 有哪些宠物友好的城市？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2168">36:08</a> 宠物安乐死是怎么样的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2369">39:29</a> 如何挑选一家合格的宠物医院？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lskdr5tHPV7Z6iaDwutQL2h0dq2N.m4a" length="40407120" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:41:38</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flo5ag2jyc7qg6oThxNQtZynvQiX.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
